summary='September 12 user-requested dead-space/corner revision complete: 27 internal quiet-gap cuts removed 8.833s plus 1.8s from ending. New Tight Resolve export 2120frames/70.667s; presenter zoom0.33 versus0.28 (17.86% larger), pan-361.8 tilt-821, flush lower-left. Original HeyGen and ElevenLabs Woman Over40/Natural/synthesis1.1 sources retained; all28 audio/presenter intervals cut together, no extra speed change. Exact244 words/76captions retained. Full decode passed, zero-lag audio correlations >0.99999, no internal quiet gaps>0.2s. All9scene boundaries inspected. Raw4fps machine review approved transcript/pacing/lipsync but inaccurately described future enlargement and CTA captions below graphic; native frames contradict these layout flags, documented in reconciliation. Revised Cut Room frames and30cloud images verified. MP4 and DRP delivered; previous versions preserved. Technical review only, not human approval or commercial source-photo clearance.'
r['context_notes']+=' '+summary;r['calibration']['next_action']='User review of completed 70.67-second Tight revision; source-photo clearance still required before campaign use.'
